---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Return Policy" description="Cybex Precision Gunworx return and refund policy for firearms, accessories, and apparel.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Return Policy</span></div>
      <h1>Return & Refund Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Return Policy</h2>
        <p>We stand behind every build. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, we're here to make it right.</p>

        <h2>Non-Firearm Items</h2>
        <p>Accessories, optics, and apparel may be returned within 30 days of delivery in unused, original condition. Buyer pays return shipping unless the item is defective.</p>

        <h2>Firearms & Serialized Items</h2>
        <p>All firearm, receiver and custom-build sales are <strong>final and non-returnable</strong>. We cannot accept returns, exchanges or refunds on firearms once an order has shipped.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Inspect on receipt.</strong> Check your firearm at your FFL before completing the transfer. Report any shipping damage or defect to us within 48 hours of delivery to your FFL, and keep all packaging.</li>
          <li><strong>Defects</strong> are repaired or replaced under our warranty – contact us first. Do not ship a firearm back without our written authorization; returns must go FFL-to-FFL.</li>
          <li><strong>Failed background check / denied transfer.</strong> If your FFL cannot legally release the item, it must be returned to us FFL-to-FFL. Refunds are issued after we receive it, less shipping, FFL fees and any restocking costs.</li>
          <li><strong>Custom and special-order items</strong> are made for you and cannot be returned or cancelled once work begins.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Warranty</h2>
        <p>All CPG-branded builds carry a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. This warranty does not cover normal wear, modifications by unauthorized parties, or damage from misuse.</p>

        <h2>How to Request a Return</h2>
        <p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:jmurphy@cybexinc.com">jmurphy@cybexinc.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+14197400456">(419) 740-0456</a> with your order number and reason for return. We'll provide return instructions within 1 business day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
